    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sanam Yaal Macbudka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sannaddii lixaad, bisheedii lixaad maalinteedii shanaad intii aan gurigaygii dhex fadhiyeyey, oo ay odayaashii dalka Yahuudah i hor fadhiyeyeen ayaa gacantii Sayidka Rabbiga ahu igu soo kor degtay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa intaan wax fiirinayay waxaa ii muuqday wax muuqashadiisu u ekayd dab oo kale, oo qaarkiisa dambe wuxuu u ekaa dab, oo qaarkiisa horena wuxuu u ekaa dhuxul cadaatay oo dhalaalaysa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wax gacan u eg buu igu soo taagay, oo wuxuu igu dhegay timahayga, oo ruuxii ayaa dhulka iyo samada dhexdooda kor iigu qaaday, oo waxyaalihii Ilaah i tusay wuxuu iigu keenay Yeruusaalem, iyo iridda gudaha ku taal albaabkeeda xagga woqooyi u sii jeeda, oo halkaas waxaa yiil kursigii sanamkii hinaasada, kaasoo hinaasada kiciya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo bal eeg, ammaantii Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil ayaa halkaas joogtay, oo waxay u ekayd sidii muuqashadii aan bannaanka ku arkay oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasuu igu yidhi, Wiilka Aadamow, bal haatan indhaha xagga woqooyi ku taag. Markaasaan indhaha kor ugu taagay jidkii xagga woqooyi, oo waxaan xaggii woqooyi iriddii meeshii allabariga ku arkay sanamkan hinaasada ee iridda ka taagan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu kaloo igu sii yidhi, Wiilka Aadamow, ma u jeedda waxa ay samaynayaan, xataa waxyaalaha waaweyn oo karaahiyada ah ee ay reer binu Israa'iil halkan ku sameeyaan si aan meeshayda quduuska ah uga sii fogaado? Laakiinse bal haddana waxaad arki doontaa waxyaalo karaahiyo ah oo tan ka sii weyn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana wuxuu i geeyey albaabkii barxadda, oo markaan wax fiiriyey waxaan arkay god derbiga ku dhex yaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu igu yidhi, Wiilka Aadamow, bal haddana derbiga qod, oo markaan derbigii qoday waxaan arkay albaab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu igu yidhi, Sii gal, oo bal fiiri waxyaalaha karaahiyada iyo sharka ah oo ay halkan ku samaynayaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed waan galay oo waxaan arkay cayn kasta oo wax gurguurta ah, iyo xayawaan karaahiyo ah, iyo sanamyadii reer binu Israa'iil oo dhan oo lagu taswiiray derbiga hareerihiisa oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa iyagii halkaas ku hor taagnaa toddobaatan nin oo odayaashii reer binu Israa'iil ka mid ahaa, oo waxaa dhexdooda taagnaa Ya'asanyaah ina Shaafaan, oo ninkood kastaaba wuxuu gacanta ku haystay idankiisii, oo waxaa kor uga baxayay caraftii qiiqii fooxa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu igu yidhi, Wiilka Aadamow, ma aragtay waxa odayaashii reer binu Israa'iil ay gudcurka ku sameeyaan, oo ninkood kastaaba uu qolladihiisa taswiirta ku sameeyo? Waayo, waxay isyidhaahdaan, Rabbigu inooma jeedo, waayo, Rabbigu dhulkuu ka tegey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba wuxuu igu sii yidhi, Bal haddana waxaad arki doontaa waxyaalo kale oo karaahiyo ah oo kuwan ka sii weyn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu i geeyey albaabkii iriddii gurigii Rabbiga oo xagga woqooyi u sii jeeday, oo waxaan halkaas ku arkay naagaha fadhiya oo sanamkii Tammuus u ooyaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu igu yidhi, Waxaas ma aragtay, Wiilka Aadamow? Bal haddana waxaad arki doontaa waxyaalo kale oo karaahiyo ah oo kuwan ka sii weyn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana wuxuu i geeyey barxaddii hoose oo gurigii Rabbiga, oo bal eeg, iriddii macbudkii Rabbiga, meel u dhaxaysa balbalada iyo meeshii allabariga waxaa taagnaa rag shan iyo labaatan ku dhow iyagoo dhabarka macbudkii Rabbiga u sii jeediyey, wejigana xagga bari u sii jeediyey, oo waxay caabudayeen qorraxda bari jirta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu igu yidhi, Waxan ma aragtay, Wiilka Aadamow? Tanu ma wax dadka Yahuudah u fudud baa inay sameeyaan waxyaalaha karaahiyada ah ee ay halkan ku samaynayaan? Waayo, dalkii dulmi bay ka buuxiyeen oo mar kalay u noqdeen inay iga cadhaysiiyaan, oo bal eeg, laantii ayay sanka u dhoweeyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidaas daraaddeed weli cadhaan ku shaqayn doonaa, indhahaygu uma tudhi doonaan, oo innaba uma aan nixi doono, oo in kastoo ay dhegahaygu qaylo weyn ugu qayliyaanna innaba ma aan maqli doono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
